# Every Engine v2 program on a machine shared with today's system (Engine v2 O17, #2810): the worlds (worldd@), the
# gateways, the directory and the origin share this slice's memory, so the new system can never take today's.
# O14 (v2/docs/machines.md): today's worlds may use at most 26 GB of a 31 GB machine; 3 GB here leaves them that.
# A world's own limit (worldd@.service, 2 GB) holds inside it. No swap, as for a world.
[Unit]
Description=Souls Engine v2 programs

[Slice]
MemoryMax=3G
MemorySwapMax=0
